[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17950.948, "timestamp": "04:59:10", "text": "私はHP1です。 一体どういうことだ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17953.59, "timestamp": "04:59:13", "text": "私はHPを1台持っています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17956.628, "timestamp": "04:59:16", "text": "待って、[息切れ] HPが1しかない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17959.91, "timestamp": "04:59:19", "text": "え、何？ あれってヨクナじゃない？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17963.51, "timestamp": "04:59:23", "text": "また、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17976.868, "timestamp": "04:59:36", "text": "メインクエストを完了してください。 ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17979.11, "timestamp": "04:59:39", "text": "最高の体験をするには、溶けゆく夜空の下を探してみてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17980.788, "timestamp": "04:59:40", "text": "。"}]